{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C3\", \"C2\", \"C1\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C3\", \"C2\", \"C1\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C2最均衡，既写出喜欢越来越难收住，也把对亲近无法长久的担忧和自我克制连起来；C3保留的内在动机更多，但时间流逝带来的失去之惧较弱；C1自然顺畅，却遗漏了不让期待牵着自己走这一层。keep：C3明确保留了不愿让对方为难、不愿被期待牵着走、盼望被理解却自行消化且不催促等内容；C2少了避免对方为难，C1还少了对期待的主动克制。cover：C2最能解释为何沉醉逐渐变成迫切，因为喜欢难以收住、亲近可能留不住，而他又压着自己不去催促；C1次之，C3虽然写出无法决定亲近能持续多久，却没有明确写出害怕失去。lean：C3把珍藏、避让、自我克制和盼望被理解压缩成一个连续转折，心理步骤最少；C2次之，C1单独再说一次想把喜欢留在心里，略显重复。plain：C1的怕它留不住、不该催对方等表达最自然，像一个人在讲自己的心事；C2多了一层解释性的心理措辞，C3则因压缩过度而显得像对心理过程的提纲式概括。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c27a8a43-d431-4a9f-808e-5f006ad95e43", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T230429719562Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.75, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:05:44.463823+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c87994cb42ce1eaf41126c5bff929420c24c2cde5207873982e3052bc2c9f573", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "59